DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
18170::$$$message_0139_0000_0000$$$::I'll check out the lobby.[lr]::
18171::$$$message_0139_0000_0001$$$::Leys and Sella should be there right now.::
18172::$$$message_0139_0001_0000$$$::"Leysritt, have you finished organizing the wine cellar!?[lr]::
18173::$$$message_0139_0001_0001$$$::It hasn't been used for a decade, so it's too late to fix anything that goes wrong. You can repair the walls here later, so hurry up and attend to the cellar!"::
18174::$$$message_0139_0002_0000$$$::"...This takes priority. Nobody uses the wine cellar. It won't bother Illya that it's run-down."::
18175::$$$message_0139_0003_0000$$$::"D-did the mistress say that herself!? She told you to ignore the cellar!?"[lr]::
18176::$$$message_0139_0003_0001$$$::"...Not really. I'm cleaning places that people can actually see. I think Illya will be sad if she sees the walls falling apart."::
18177::$$$message_0139_0004_0000$$$::"That much is obvious. She's unhappy staying in this decrepit old castle to begin with."::
18178::$$$message_0139_0005_0000$$$::"Oh, why must our mistress live in this backwater forest? [cacheimage storage=セラ02e(遠)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セラ02e(遠)]You have much to answer for, Shirou Emiya!"::
18179::$$$message_0139_0006_0000$$$::"Huh? Me?"[lr]::
18180::$$$message_0139_0006_0001$$$::She's suddenly pointing at me.[lr]::
18181::$$$message_0139_0006_0002$$$::...I guess Sella noticed me here all along.::
18182::$$$message_0139_0007_0000$$$::"Shirou? Oh, it's really him.[lr]::
18183::$$$message_0139_0007_0001$$$::Hello, Shirou. [cacheimage storage=リズ02a(近)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=リズ02a(近)]Guten Tag."[lr]::
18184::$$$message_0139_0007_0002$$$::"Hello, Leys. [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=800 count=3]Guten Tag."::
18185::$$$message_0139_0008_0000$$$::We exchange a leisurely greeting.[lr]::
18186::$$$message_0139_0008_0001$$$::It's a secret greeting between me and Leys,[lr]::
18187::$$$message_0139_0008_0002$$$::but Sella does not look pleased.::
18188::$$$message_0139_0009_0000$$$::"Her name is Leysritt to you, Master Emiya. I must ask that you observe propriety and not abbreviate her name.[lr]::
18189::$$$message_0139_0009_0001$$$::Our and our mistress's names are special. It is terribly unpleasant to hear a commoner such as you call us by nicknames."[lr]::
18190::$$$message_0139_0009_0002$$$::"Don't mind her, Shirou. Sella's sad she got left out. She's jealous that her name is too short to have a nickname."::
18191::$$$message_0139_0010_0000$$$::"Hush, Leysritt...[cacheimage storage=セラ02a(遠)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=セラ02a(遠)] Master Emiya. Leysritt was making a joke. Do not take her at her word."::
18192::$$$message_0139_0011_0000$$$::"Really? Then maybe I should call you Ms. Sella. That sounds cuter."::
18193::$$$message_0139_0012_0000$$$::"Be silent, Master Emiya.[lr]::
18194::$$$message_0139_0012_0001$$$::We are not well-acquainted enough for you to call me anything!"::
18195::$$$message_0139_0013_0000$$$::I made her mad.[lr]::
18196::$$$message_0139_0013_0001$$$::I'm actually more comfortable being a little more polite to her, though.::
18197::$$$message_0139_0014_0000$$$::"...Ahem. [cacheimage storage=セラ01a(遠)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セラ01a(遠)]Do pardon any offense, Master Emiya. We have been too preoccupied to give you a proper welcome.[lr]::
18198::$$$message_0139_0014_0001$$$::...May I ask what business you have here today?[lr]::
18199::$$$message_0139_0014_0002$$$::I don't believe you have any appointments with my mistress."::
18200::$$$message_0139_0015_0000$$$::"I don't have an appointment, but I just came here to see what's going on."::
18201::$$$message_0139_0016_0000$$$::"...Oh. Shirou, you're like a policeman on patrol to make sure Illya's safe?"[lr]::
18202::$$$message_0139_0016_0001$$$::"Hm... You could say that, but you already have Berserker here.[lr]::
18203::$$$message_0139_0016_0002$$$::I know she's way safer here than in the city. I'm more here to hang out than to patrol the area."::
18204::$$$message_0139_0017_0000$$$::"Hmph. See, Leysritt? This is all humans amount to. They care about no one but each other. We can hardly expect one to show genuine concern for our mistress."[lr]::
18205::$$$message_0139_0017_0001$$$::"...I think Shirou's shy. You're too mean to humans, Sella."::
18206::$$$message_0139_0018_0000$$$::"That is my job. Our duty is to protect the mistress, is it not? I defend her pride, while you guard her from physical threats."::
18207::$$$message_0139_0019_0000$$$::"How can you expect me to let down my guard around humans, much less exchange courtesies with the son of Kiritsugu Emiya? I thought you despised that villain."::
18208::$$$message_0139_0020_0000$$$::"...I do. I hate Kiritsugu. Sorry, Shirou, but Kiritsugu was horrible."::
18209::$$$message_0139_0021_0000$$$::I don't pick up any hatred from her faltering words.[lr]::
18210::$$$message_0139_0021_0001$$$::Leys only dislikes Kiritsugu Emiya because he made Illya cry.[lr]::
18211::$$$message_0139_0021_0002$$$::...I can't defend him for that. It makes me upset, too.::
18212::$$$message_0139_0022_0000$$$::"It's okay, Leys. You're right to hold it against my old man, and it makes sense that you'd blame his son, too."[lr]::
18213::$$$message_0139_0022_0001$$$::"...Hmph. Perhaps you aren't as graceless as you look. I'm glad you're aware of that, at least."::
18214::$$$message_0139_0023_0000$$$::"Yeah. I'm my father's son. I have to carry on his responsibilities.[lr]::
18215::$$$message_0139_0023_0001$$$::So I'll accept your dislike for him, too.[lr]::
18216::$$$message_0139_0023_0002$$$::But if you feel that way about all humans who have nothing to do with this..."::
18217::$$$message_0139_0024_0000$$$::"...If I feel that way about humans, then what? You won't allow it?"[lr]::
18218::$$$message_0139_0024_0001$$$::"No. I guess I'd ask you to reconsider your opinion. It isn't like you."::
18219::$$$message_0139_0025_0000$$$::"How insincere. How is it not like me?"[lr]::
18220::$$$message_0139_0025_0001$$$::"It just isn't. It's like saying you hate all fruits because you don't like apples. It's so extreme."::
18221::$$$message_0139_0026_0000$$$::"...Extreme, [cacheimage storage=リズ01e(近)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 opacity=0 time=500 storage=リズ01e(近)]you say?"[lr]::
18222::$$$message_0139_0026_0001$$$::"Yeah, Sella. You're extreme."[lr]::
18223::$$$message_0139_0026_0002$$$::We both nod.::
18224::$$$message_0139_0027_0000$$$::"...I see. It does go against my sense of aesthetics, I suppose.[lr]::
18225::$$$message_0139_0027_0001$$$::...I will be more precise and merited in my dislikes in the future."::
18226::$$$message_0139_0028_0000$$$::"...Then, if you'll excuse us, Master Emiya, we have other duties to attend to."[lr]::
18227::$$$message_0139_0028_0001$$$::"What? But this was our last job. You're lying, Sella. We need to serve Shirou tea."[lr]::
18228::$$$message_0139_0028_0002$$$::"Listen to yourself![lr]::
18229::$$$message_0139_0028_0003$$$::Have you already forgotten that I just asked you to clean up the wine cellar!?"::
18230::$$$message_0139_0029_0000$$$::"...Sella, you're mixing private and professional matters. If you want to clean up the cellar so badly, you can do it yourself."[lr]::
18231::$$$message_0139_0029_0001$$$::"I [font italic=true]am[font italic=false] doing what I can, but brute manual labor is your responsibility. My thin arms couldn't possibly move the heavy wine barrels around."::
18232::$$$message_0139_0030_0000$$$::"You're lying again, Sella. You don't go underground because you don't want to go to the wine cellar.[lr]::
18233::$$$message_0139_0030_0001$$$::I know you actually[line len=2]"[lr]::
18234::$$$message_0139_0030_0002$$$::"H-hold your tongue, Leysritt! We are in front of a guest. Don't say anything that[line len=2]"::
18235::$$$message_0139_0031_0000$$$::"Hey Shirou, did you know, Sella acts tough, but she's afraid of gho[line len=2]"::
18236::$$$message_0139_0032_0000$$$::"AAAAAAAAAHHH! No, that's not true at all![lr]::
18237::$$$message_0139_0032_0001$$$::Forget you heard that, Shirou Emiya. You never heard any of this!"::
18238::$$$message_0139_0033_0000$$$::Sella doesn't make a move against me, despite how flustered she is. What a professional.[lr]::
18239::$$$message_0139_0033_0001$$$::I'm impressed. If this was Tohsaka, she'd be caving my skull in by now.[fg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=398 index=1500 top=102 time=100 storage=リズ01b(近)]::
18240::$$$message_0139_0034_0000$$$::"Leysritt, give a proper explanation! You're just spewing baseless fantasies![lr]::
18241::$$$message_0139_0034_0001$$$::And we are going to the wine cellar, right now!"[lr]::
18242::$$$message_0139_0034_0002$$$::"...Okay. I'll go with you. Then you won't be scared, right?"::
18243::$$$message_0139_0035_0000$$$::"I just told you I'm not scared of ghosts![lr]::
18244::$$$message_0139_0035_0001$$$::...Fine, I don't need you! I'll tidy up the wine cellar on my own![lr]::
18245::$$$message_0139_0035_0002$$$::...It's all right, I'm not scared. I'm one of the few perfected homunculi on this earth. Ghosts are nothing to be afraid of!"::
18246::$$$message_0139_0036_0000$$$::Sella's shouting in a rare display of emotion.[lr]::
18247::$$$message_0139_0036_0001$$$::She's trying so hard that I feel a little bad for her.::
18248::$$$message_0139_0037_0000$$$::"Uh...so there are ghosts here?"[lr]::
18249::$$$message_0139_0037_0001$$$::"...Yeah. They showed up in the forest a while ago. Then Illya said that she saw a ghost that looked like a demon underground when she was playing at night."::
18250::$$$message_0139_0038_0000$$$::"No such thing ever happened! Temporary lodging it might be, but this is still a castle of the Einzberns! While I can't rule out Elementals, lesser spirits like wraiths shouldn't be able to enter![lr]::
18251::$$$message_0139_0038_0001$$$::I-I'll prove it to you right now!"::
18252::$$$message_0139_0039_0000$$$::"Oooh. Good girl, Sella."[lr]::
18253::$$$message_0139_0039_0001$$$::"Hardly. I'm only going to check on the wine cellar."::
18254::$$$message_0139_0040_0000$$$::The wine cellar is underground?[lr]::
18255::$$$message_0139_0040_0001$$$::So it's a castle dungeon... That does sound scary.[lr]::
18256::$$$message_0139_0040_0002$$$::Sella must be pretty brave to go down there by herself.[lr]::
18257::$$$message_0139_0040_0003$$$::Still, though...::
18258::$$$message_0139_0041_0000$$$::"...What? You look like you have something to say, Master Emiya."[lr]::
18259::$$$message_0139_0041_0001$$$::"I was just thinking that if you're going to look for ghosts, then there's no point in going right now.[lr]::
18260::$$$message_0139_0041_0002$$$::Illya saw it at night, didn't she? So they're not going to show up unless you go down there late at night."::
18261::$$$message_0139_0042_0000$$$::"Aaaah, [cacheimage storage=セラ01i(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=10 time=400 count=-4][chgfg pos=l time=200 storage=セラ01i(中)]what manner of devil are you!? You demand that I do something so terrifying!? What am I supposed to do if I actually run into a ghost!?"[lr]::
18262::$$$message_0139_0042_0001$$$::"I knew it. You're afraid of ghosts, aren't you?"[lr]::
18263::$$$message_0139_0042_0002$$$::"Ack."[lr]::
18264::$$$message_0139_0042_0003$$$::Sella freezes in her tracks.::
18265::$$$message_0139_0043_0000$$$::"Rrgh, I misjudged you, Shirou Emiya![lr]::
18266::$$$message_0139_0043_0001$$$::You've poisoned Leysritt against me!"[lr]::
18267::$$$message_0139_0043_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
18268::$$$message_0139_0043_0003$$$::I'm pretty sure Sella did that herself. In fact, she landed herself in this entire situation.::
18269::$$$message_0139_0044_0000$$$::"...Very well. If you insist, then I will venture underground at midnight to acquire concrete proof, even if it is outside of the scope of my duties.[lr]::
18270::$$$message_0139_0044_0001$$$::Just you watch, Shirou Emiya! As Lady Illyasviel's[line len=2]no, as an Einzbern homunculus, I will prove to you[cacheimage storage=セラ02e(中)][wvl][movefg textoff=0 opacity=128 left=-377 top=44 time=500 accel=3 storage=セラ02e(中)] that I am without flaw!"::
18271::$$$message_0139_0045_0000$$$::"...And off she goes. Are you really okay letting Sella go by herself?"[lr]::
18272::$$$message_0139_0045_0001$$$::What if she passes out in the cellar?::
18273::$$$message_0139_0046_0000$$$::"It's okay. Sella isn't as strong as you think. She'll come crying back to us."[lr]::
18274::$$$message_0139_0046_0001$$$::Leys smiles happily, for some reason.[lr]::
18275::$$$message_0139_0046_0002$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
18276::$$$message_0139_0046_0003$$$::I wonder who the smile is meant for.::
18277::$$$message_0139_0047_0000$$$::"Anyway, it's teatime. I'll go call Illya, so go wait in the salon."[lr]::
18278::$$$message_0139_0047_0001$$$::"Okay. Thanks, Leys."[lr]::
18279::$$$message_0139_0047_0002$$$::"Yeah. I like how honest you are."[lr]::
18280::$$$message_0139_0047_0003$$$::Leys goes up the center stairs.[lr]::
18281::$$$message_0139_0047_0004$$$::She's probably gone off to find Illya.::
18282::$$$message_0139_0048_0000$$$::I head to the salon.[lr]::
18283::$$$message_0139_0048_0001$$$::It took a lot of stamina to come out here. Tea with Illya and Leys is exactly what I need.[lr]::
18284::$$$message_0139_0048_0002$$$::Sella will be back soon enough, I'm sure. Looks like it's going to be a lively afternoon.::
918175::$$$message_9139_0003_0000$$$::"D-did the mistress say that herself!? She told you to ignore the cellar!?"[r]::�E